  "details": "-Issue began on 4/1/2025 AEST.\n\n-The \"Error\" avatar is displayed in local testing(see img1)\n\n-However, the correct avatar is displayed in the player's profile.(see img1)\n\n-The \"Error\" avatar is unable to use VRCStations.\n\n-A similar situation has happened numerous times before, but it is solved by either launching VR Chat in steam (not local testing) or changing the client installation path(see img3)\n\nThings I've tried to solve this:\n\n-Switching to another avatar\n\n-Clearing local profile data and Local avatar Data(see img2)\n\n-Changing the installation path\n\n-launching VR Chat on steam.\n\n-Upgrading and downgrading SDKBase in the VRC Companion app.\n\n-Reinstalling SDKBase\n\n-Reinstalling VR Chat on steam.\n\n-Running Local testing on a different computer",
